# ADK deploy and infrastructure

Do not run deploy or infra commands unless the user explicitly confirms.

**Deploy to dev:** Run `agents-cli deploy` only after the user approves. See the Deployment Guide.

**Production:** Ask which option they want before proceeding:

- Option A: simple single-project (`agents-cli infra single-project`)
- Option B: full CI/CD (`agents-cli infra cicd`)

`agents-cli scaffold enhance` and `agents-cli scaffold upgrade` also need explicit approval when they change deployment or CI/CD.
